  "description": "Durable analytics delivery and backfill for Modulus on EF Core: per-tenant resumable backfill runs with checkpoints, an entity-backed source, a transactional queue of captured analytics records with duplicate-safe enqueue, atomic claiming across replicas, a retry schedule, dead-lettering and purge, and the background worker that hands batches to the analytics sinks.",
